ple preparation, which included SP3-based cleanup and digestion by Glu-C in phosphate buffer pH 7.6 (leading to high cleavage rates at the c-terminal side of both glutamate and aspartate residues). LCMS in triplicate technical runs (in addition to the biological triplicates of the four protein types: 3x3x4=36 runs) was carried out on a HPLC 1200 system (Agilent Technologies) with a 15 cm long C18 picofrit analytical column (100 µm internal diameter, 5 µm bead size, Nikkyo Technos Co., Tokyo, Japan) connected to a LTQ Orbitrap Velos Pro mass spectrometer (Thermo Scientific). WT_MnFe samples comprise mass spectrometry raw files files named S01-S03, WT_FeFe correspond to S04-S06, G68L_MnFe to S07-S09 and finally G68L_FeFe to S10-S12.\n'}], 'model': 'gpt-5.4-nano-2026-03-17', 'store': True, 'temperature': 0.3}}
